graph TD
    A[DNA Replication Error] --> B{Error Type?}
    
    B -->|Base-Base Mismatch| C[G-T, A-C, etc.]
    B -->|Insertion-Deletion Loop| D[IDL 1-4 nt]
    B -->|Complex Error| E[Multiple Errors]
    
    C --> F[Helix Distortion]
    D --> F
    E --> F
    
    %% MutS Recognition
    F --> G[MutS Homodimer Scanning]
    G --> H{Mismatch Detection?}
    
    H -->|No Mismatch| I[Continue Scanning]
    I --> G
    H -->|Mismatch Found| J[MutS Binding]
    
    J --> K{Mismatch Type Verification?}
    K -->|G-T Most Recognized| L[Strong MutS Binding]
    K -->|Other Mismatches| M[Variable Binding Affinity]
    K -->|IDL| N[IDL-Specific Recognition]
    
    L --> O[ATP Binding to MutS]
    M --> O
    N --> O
    
    O --> P[MutS Conformational Change]
    P --> Q[Sliding Clamp Formation]
    
    %% MutL Recruitment
    Q --> R[MutL Homodimer Recruitment]
    R --> S{MutS-MutL Complex?}
    S -->|Formation| T[MutS-MutL-DNA Ternary Complex]
    S -->|Failed| U[Abortive Recognition]
    
    T --> V[ATP Hydrolysis]
    V --> W[MutS-MutL Translocation]
    W --> X{GATC Site Search?}
    
    %% Strand Discrimination
    X -->|Scanning| Y[Searching for GATC]
    Y --> Z{Hemimethylated GATC?}
    
    Z -->|Not Found| AA[Continue Search]
    AA --> Y
    Z -->|Found| AB{Methylation Status?}
    
    AB -->|Hemimethylated| AC[Dam Methylation Site]
    AB -->|Fully Methylated| AD[Wrong Strand]
    AB -->|Unmethylated| AE[Abnormal State]
    
    %% MutH Activation
    AC --> AF{Strand Identity?}
    AF -->|New Strand Unmethylated| AG[Correct Target Identified]
    AF -->|Old Strand Methylated| AH[Preserve This Strand]
    
    AG --> AI[MutH Endonuclease Recruitment]
    AI --> AJ{MutL Activates MutH?}
    AJ -->|Yes| AK[MutH Activation]
    AJ -->|No| AL[Failed Activation]
    
    AK --> AM[MutH Incision at GATC]
    AM --> AN[Nick in Unmethylated Strand]
    AN --> AO{Nick Position?}
    
    AO -->|5' to Mismatch| AP[5' Nick]
    AO -->|3' to Mismatch| AQ[3' Nick]
    
    %% Excision - 5' to 3' Direction
    AP --> AR{Exonuclease Selection?}
    AR -->|RecJ| AS[5' to 3' ssDNA Exonuclease]
    AR -->|ExoVII| AT[Alternative 5' to 3']
    
    AS --> AU[/Degrade Toward Mismatch/]
    AT --> AU
    AU --> AV[Pass Mismatch Site]
    AV --> AW[/Continue Degradation/]
    AW --> AX[SSB Coating ssDNA]
    
    %% Excision - 3' to 5' Direction
    AQ --> AY{Exonuclease Selection?}
    AY -->|ExoI| AZ[3' to 5' ssDNA Exonuclease]
    AY -->|ExoX| BA[Alternative 3' to 5']
    AY -->|ExoVII| BB[Bidirectional Option]
    
    AZ --> BC[/Degrade Toward Mismatch/]
    BA --> BC
    BB --> BC
    BC --> BD[Pass Mismatch Site]
    BD --> BE[/Continue Degradation/]
    BE --> BF[SSB Protection]
    
    %% Termination of Excision
    AW --> BG{Excision Complete?}
    BE --> BG
    BG -->|Sufficient| BH[/Stop Signal/]
    BG -->|Insufficient| BI(\1)
    
    BH --> BJ[Single-Strand Gap]
    BJ --> BK{Gap Size?}
    BK -->|Short <100 nt| BL[Small Gap]
    BK -->|Long >1000 nt| BM[Large Gap]
    
    %% DNA Resynthesis
    BL --> BN[DNA Pol III Recognition]
    BM --> BN
    BN --> BO{Holoenzyme Assembly?}
    BO -->|Complete| BP[Processive Synthesis]
    BO -->|Partial| BQ[Distributive Synthesis]
    
    BP --> BR[dNTP Incorporation]
    BR --> BS[Rapid Gap Filling]
    BS --> BT[High Fidelity Synthesis]
    BT --> BU[Gap Filled]
    
    %% Ligation
    BU --> BV{Nick Sealing?}
    BV -->|Ready| BW[DNA Ligase]
    BV -->|Not Ready| BX[Additional Processing]
    
    BW --> BY[NAD+ Ligase LigA]
    BY --> BZ[Phosphodiester Bond]
    BZ --> CA[Nick Sealed]
    
    CA --> CB[Restored DNA Helix]
    CB --> CC{Repair Verification?}
    CC -->|Successful| CD[High Fidelity DNA]
    CC -->|Residual Error| CE[Secondary MMR]
    
    %% Final Outcomes
    CD --> CF[1000x Error Reduction]
    CF --> CG[Genome Stability]
    CG --> CH[Cell Survival]
    CH --> CI[Replication Fidelity]
    
    %% Error Pathways
    U --> CJ[Mismatch Escapes]
    AL --> CJ
    AD --> CK[Wrong Strand Risk]
    AE --> CL[Dam Methylation Defect]
    CE --> CM[Persistent Mismatch]
    
    CJ --> CN[Reduced Fidelity]
    CK --> CN
    CM --> CN
    CN --> CO(\1)
    
    %% Regulation
    AX --> CP{SSB Saturation?}
    BF --> CP
    CP -->|Sufficient| BG
    CP -->|Limited| CQ[/Slower Degradation/]
    

